# Copy to .env.local only if you need local configuration.
# Cloud uses BYOK: users enter provider keys in their browsers.
# Do NOT store production provider keys or real passwords in this file.
#
# Optional local site-lock test (uncomment and supply private values):
# SITE_LOCK_ENABLED=true
# SITE_LOCK_PASSWORD=replace_with_a_strong_unique_password
# SITE_LOCK_SECRET=replace_with_a_long_random_secret
#
# Configure production/preview secrets privately in Vercel settings.
# A site lock is not a substitute for Deployment Protection or an audit.
